 Incident  Diagnosis   Change
 Agent      Agent       Agent
    │        │           │
    └────────┼───────────┘
             ▼
      Governance Gateway
             │
   ┌─────────┼────────────┐
   ▼         ▼            ▼
Identity   Policy       Risk
Service     PDP        Engine
             │
      Human Approval
             │
        Tool Gateway
    ┌────────┼────────┬────────┐
    ▼        ▼        ▼        ▼
